# ACME ERP — Inventory Subsystem Implementation Plan

> Governed by [inventory_implementation_contract.md](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/docs/inventory_implementation_contract.md)

---

## Overview

Implement a production-grade, multi-store, batch-tracked, FEFO-driven inventory engine with an immutable stock ledger, inter-store transfers, store requisitions, purchase invoice matching, POS billing, and GST compliance — all within a dedicated PostgreSQL `inventory` schema.

The implementation follows 5 sequential phases. Each phase is self-contained and results in a deployable, testable increment.

